{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Blue Paradise: Joyful Survival",
    "steam_appid": 3659900,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accidents happen to people, and it seems that it also happens to huge ships. It's a pity that you don't remember anything, and even worse that you can't swim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that's nothing, it's so beautiful here, everything you've always dreamed of is floating around - expensive sports cars, motorbikes, chainsaws, grinders and even chickens and ostriches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's also a lot of wood here, you just have to learn how to construct various things to survive here and get to the sunken ship and save those who survived.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blue Paradise is a parody of a survival game, where you will have plenty of unhealthy, processed food and drink. You will be able to drive a forklift, expensive cars and quads, you just have to build some bridges to have something to drive on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't worry, it's mainly about having fun, opening crates and containers and building wooden structures. You can also raise chickens or emus. Relax on an inflatable pink flamingo and just enjoy the sun, warm sand and good fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is dirt cheap, so don't worry about anything and just have fun.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accidents happen to people, and it seems that it also happens to huge ships. It's a pity that you don't remember anything, and even worse that you can't swim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that's nothing, it's so beautiful here, everything you've always dreamed of is floating around - expensive sports cars, motorbikes, chainsaws, grinders and even chickens and ostriches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's also a lot of wood here, you just have to learn how to construct various things to survive here and get to the sunken ship and save those who survived.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blue Paradise is a parody of a survival game, where you will have plenty of unhealthy, processed food and drink. You will be able to drive a forklift, expensive cars and quads, you just have to build some bridges to have something to drive on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't worry, it's mainly about having fun, opening crates and containers and building wooden structures. You can also raise chickens or emus. Relax on an inflatable pink flamingo and just enjoy the sun, warm sand and good fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is dirt cheap, so don't worry about anything and just have fun.</p>",
    "short_description": "You woke up on an island. Everything you dreamed of is around you - containers full of things. Too bad you can't swim. Think, run, use tools, build, eat and drink as much as you can. Have fun and head towards the sunken ship to become a hero. An unforgettable adventure for the price of a bus ticket.",
